+## Every proof helper rule in `verification.k`
+
+| ID | Lines | Rule / role | Static judgment |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| V1 | 14 | `bracketSpec` tests whether the string is empty. | Correct. |
+| V2 | 15 | Empty string returns `D == 0`. | Correct. |
